      "receiptSource": "Original Receipt in \u0027\u003Ci\u003EThe Forme of Cury\u003C/i\u003E\u0027 by the Chief Master-Cook of King Richard II, c1390 (\u003Ca href=\u0022references.html#cury-1390\u0022\u003E\u003Cb\u003ECury 1390\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/a\u003E)",
      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003EGourds in Potage:\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\nTake young gourds pare them and carve them on pieces. Cast them in good broth, and do thereto a good part of onions minced. Take Pork salted, grind it and ally it therewith and with yolks of eggs. Do thereto saffron and salt, and present it forth with \u003Ca href=\u0022spice-powders.html\u0022\u003E\u003Cb\u003Epowder douce\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/a\u003E.\u003Cbr\u003E"
